Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 19:04:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] [Quantization] Prefer Humming before Marlin backends

Prioritize Humming in dense and MoE backend selection, including NVFP4 W4A16 fallback selection.

Validation: 9 existing CPU selection/oracle tests passed; pre-commit passed. GSM8K evaluation could not start because device detection failed with an NVML driver/library mismatch.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: jinzhen.ljz <jinzhen.ljz@antgroup.com>
